{"tool_name":"neurphologyj","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>ImageJ macro for the morphometry of neurites. &gt; NeurphologyJ; it is capable of automatically quantifying neuronal morphology such as soma number and size, neurite length, neurite ending points and attachment points. NeurphologyJ is implemented as a plugin to ImageJ, an open-source Java-based image-processing and analysis platform.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>ImageJ macro for the morphometry of neurites. &gt; NeurphologyJ; it is capable of automatically quantifying neuronal morphology such as soma number and size, neurite length, neurite ending points and attachment points. NeurphologyJ is implemented as a plugin to ImageJ, an open-source Java-based image-processing and analysis platform.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2018-04-27T00:14:58+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2016-10-24T13:46:16+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4242,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"66d29d36-42bf-4786-ba77-479ecb13b947","url":"/taxonomy/term/4242"},{"target_id":4438,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"efbc83c8-a58e-46c3-957a-54540ef50712","url":"/taxonomy/term/4438"},{"target_id":4439,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"07e6a9ff-45f3-42bb-951b-ba15663c485f","url":"/taxonomy/term/4439"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505205489,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Eric Hwang"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4440,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"b4e5bcf9-46be-4ac8-8390-60664ed9d79b","url":"/taxonomy/term/4440"},{"target_id":4441,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"521bc8d0-2dda-46be-b5d2-c2e985b84240","url":"/taxonomy/term/4441"},